}, q: {}\"</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any/any_cast\"><span class=\"kw1079\">std::<span class=\"me2\">any_cast</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any/any_cast\"><span class=\"kw1079\">std::<span class=\"me2\">any_cast</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>q<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>p: 42, q: Bishop\nswap(p, q)\np: Bishop, q: 42</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/any/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps two <code>any</code> objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/any","title":"std::any"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::swap(std::any)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Overloads the std::swap algorithm for std::any. Swaps the content of two any objects by calling lhs.swap(rhs)."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"swap","note":"swaps two any objects"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":92,"codeBlockCount":2}
